BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
54. 192.8899999999999864 Td
(The SNA classifies all resident economic units into five institutional sectors:) Tj
T* (1. Non-financial corporations) Tj
T* (2. Financial corporations) Tj
T* (3. General government) Tj
T* (4. Households) Tj
T* (5. Non-profit institutions serving households \(NPISH\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (All transactions are recorded between these sectors and with the rest of the world.) Tj
