10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
54. 312.8899999999999864 Td
(Shows how GVA is distributed among factors of production. Resources: GVA. Uses: Compensation of employees,) Tj
T* (Other taxes on production \(net\). Balancing item: Gross Operating Surplus/Gross Mixed Income.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
