(4. Key Changes: SNA 1993 to SNA 2008) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 636.8899999999999864 Td
(| Concept | SNA 1993 | SNA 2008 |) Tj
T* (|---|---|---|) Tj
T* (| R&D expenditure | Intermediate consumption | Capitalised \(GFCF\) |) Tj
T* (| Military weapons | Not capitalised | Capitalised if used >1 year |) Tj
T* (| Software | Partially capitalised | Fully capitalised |) Tj
T* (| Defined-benefit pension | Off-balance-sheet | On employer's balance sheet |) Tj
T* (| Financial intermediation \(FISIM\) | Narrow allocation | Broader allocation |) Tj
T* (| Non-performing loans | At face value | At market/fair value |) Tj
ET
